# Docs

- Read `docs/AI-INSTRUCTIONS.md` and `docs/CANONICAL-DOCUMENT-INDEX.md` first.
- Prefer editing canonical numbered docs from the root README “Start here” list.
- Keep supplemental/legacy docs marked as such; do not silently promote them.
- Cross-link related runbooks, checklists, and manifests when guidance changes.
- Do not invent environment-specific SLO/RPO/RTO, retention, or platform values—call them out as decisions.
